# ─── OS cruft ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ─── Editor / IDE ───────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# ─── Claude Code local state (keep the agent + skills, ignore local settings) ──
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.local.json

# ─── Secrets / env (never commit real credentials) ──────────
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
secrets/

# ─── Scratch / temp ─────────────────────────────────────────
tmp/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.log

# ─── OPTIONAL: real (private) content ───────────────────────
# The harness ships knowledge/ and projects/ as TEMPLATES + a worked example,
# which SHOULD be committed. If you fill them with real, sensitive company data
# and want to keep it out of a public repo, uncomment the lines below to ignore
# your private content while keeping the structure. (Commit the templates first,
# or add per-file exceptions.)
#
# knowledge/company.md
# knowledge/customers.md
# knowledge/product.md
# knowledge/constraints.md
# projects/*/evidence/*
# !projects/*/evidence/README.md
